{"step_index":391,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:15:04Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated with the Gemini AI Persuasive SMS Generation Engine, intelligent context synthesis from call history/notes, and the 100% editable preview modal before send.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Gemini AI Persuasive SMS Engine & Editable Review\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) now features an **AI-Powered Subtly Persuasive SMS Drafting Engine** ([`src/services/aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts)).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Context-Aware AI Copywriting (Gemini 2.5 Flash)\n- **Automatic History & Notes Synthesis:**\n  - Pulls the educator's complete file: School (`VOL`), Years in FRS (`9`), Age (`42`), FRS Knowledge (`Knows a little`), Planning Period (`3rd Period`), Room #, and requested meeting times (*Mon 1-2 PM*).\n  - Evaluates the **entire timeline of past call logs and agent notes** (e.g. previous voicemails, callbacks, or unanswered attempts).\n- **Subtly Persuasive & Empathetic Tone:**\n  - Written specifically for Florida educators (warm, consultative, respectful of busy teacher schedules).\n  - Naturally highlights their exact interest (e.g. *Guaranteed 5% Bonus*, *DROP clarity*, or *403b review*).\n  - Sized for mobile lock-screen readability (under 160–240 chars).\n\n---\n\n## 2. 100% Preview & Editable Text Modal ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx) & [`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx))\n- **Live Editing:** The agent can review, tweak, delete, or rewrite any part of the generated message.\n- **1-Tap AI Tone Focus Presets:**\n  - 🎯 **Meeting Slot Focus:** Confirms their preferred callback window (*Mon 1-2 PM*).\n  - 💰 **5% Bonus & DROP Focus:** Re-engages around state pension analysis and growth.\n  - 🏫 **Planning Period Focus:** Suggests connecting during their specific planning hour.\n- **Zero-Cost Native SIM Handoff:** Tapping **\"Open in SMS App\"** launches your phone's native Messages app with the exact drafted copy ready to send.\n\n---\n\n## How to Test:\n1. Refresh `http://localhost:8081`.\n2. Tap **Launch Power Dialer** on the **ValuTeachers** list.\n3. Tap **ValuTeachers SMS** (or tap **Text** on any profile).\n4. Watch Gemini AI compose the personalized message in real-time, click any tone preset, edit words in the box, and review the character counter!\n","Description":"Walkthrough covering AI Persuasive SMS Engine and Editable Preview","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for AI SMS drafting","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with AI SMS feature"}}]}
