{"step_index":393,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:15:08Z","content":"This capability is now implemented in **SnapDialer**.\n\n---\n\n### How the AI Persuasive SMS Engine Works:\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     AI-POWERED PERSUASIVE SMS DRAFTING                           │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                                  │\n│  [CONTEXT SYNTHESIZED BY GEMINI 2.5 FLASH]:                                      │\n│  • Educator: Joseph Adona • VOL (Volusia) • 9 Yrs in FRS • Age 42                │\n│  • Checked Report Card Needs: Guaranteed 5% bonus & 403(b) clarity               │\n│  • Requested Availability: Mon 1-2 PM (3rd Period Planning)                      │\n│  • Call History & Notes: Attempt 1 No Answer / Attempt 2 Left Voicemail          │\n│                                                                                  │\n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ DRAFT TEXT MESSAGE                       [ ✨ AI RE-DRAFT (GEMINI) ]       │  │\n│  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │\n│  │ PRESETS:  [ 🎯 Meeting Slot ]   [ 💰 5% Bonus & DROP ]   [ 🏫 Planning ]   │  │\n│  │                                                                            │  │\n│  │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\n│  │ │ Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card │ │  │\n│  │ │ from VOL regarding your 403(b) review and the 5% bonus option. I see   │ │  │\n│  │ │ you preferred Mon 1-2 PM—does that time still work for a quick 5-min   │ │  │\n│  │ │ call, or is Wed during 3rd period better?                              │ │  │\n│  │ └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\n│  │  194 characters • 100% Editable & Previewed                                │  │\n│  │                                                                            │  │\n│  │                      [ CANCEL ]    [ OPEN IN SMS APP ]                     │  │\n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities Built:\n\n1. **Intelligent Context Synthesis ([`src/services/aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts)):**\n   - When you tap **ValuTeachers SMS** in the HUD or **Draft Text** on a contact profile, Gemini analyzes:\n     - The educator's **exact checked FRS needs** (e.g., *Guaranteed 5% Bonus*, *DROP*, *Pension Analysis*).\n     - Their **handwritten meeting preferences** (*Mon 1-2 PM*).\n     - The **history of previous call attempts and your handwritten call notes** (e.g., *\"Voicemail on Monday\"*, *\"Asked to call back during 3rd period\"*).\n\n2. **Subtly Persuasive, Educator-Specific Copy:**\n   - Avoids aggressive or generic sales language; instead adopts the tone of an empathetic, dedicated Florida educator advocate.\n   - Tailored to under 200–240 characters for immediate readability on locked iPhone screens.\n\n3. **100% Editable & Previewed Before Sending ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Nothing sends automatically.** The drafted message opens directly in a full-screen text editor so you can review, add personal notes, or modify phrasing.\n   - Includes 1-tap AI focus switches:\n     - 🎯 **Meeting Slot Focus**\n     - 💰 **5% Bonus & DROP Focus**\n     - 🏫 **Planning Period Focus**\n   - Tapping **\"Open in SMS App\"** loads the exact text into your iPhone's native Messages app ready for delivery over your native carrier SIM.\n\n---\n\n### How to Test:\nRefresh your browser tab at `http://localhost:8081` (or run `npx expo start --web`), tap **Launch Power Dialer** on the **ValuTeachers - Volusia School Roster**, and tap **ValuTeachers SMS** to test the live AI composition and editor!"}
